 center of the food web. They're the most populous species on Earth, right? There's more than a

00:45:48.650 --> 00:45:54.330
 million beetle species. But they don't get a lot of focus. We tend to focus on the charismatic

00:45:54.330 --> 00:46:01.210
 megafauna, gorillas and elephants, whereas these are, you know, the foundation of the food web.

00:46:01.210 --> 00:46:08.130
 Um, yeah, we like to think of ourselves as like the Audubon Society of Insects. We do a lot of

