00:48:16.600 --> 00:48:22.660
 them. Um, and then you can do this throughout the garden. Uh, having it be in a sunny place would

00:48:22.660 --> 00:48:29.090
 be better than a shady place. Um, yeah, those are the main things, you know, go to your local nursery,

00:48:29.090 --> 00:48:35.360
